      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. so if it's being used like that so often, isn't the \"balance\" you mentioned earlier kind of a myth? if the default is basically just state censorship, shouldn't we say that internet freedom should be an absolute right that governments have no business interfering with at all?",
